<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3856/61 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7180/90 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9318/38 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4730/40 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.44/48  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7791/66   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1696.7/8.2  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     126.50/60   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6786/60   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.9561/11   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5440/60   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6228/38</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$347.50/00</p>
